{title: 576 - Awake, Awake to Love and Work}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #576 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 576}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Cm]A [Db/Ab]wake, [Eb7/Bb]awake [Ab/C]tolove and work!
[Ab/Eb]The [Db/Ab]lark [Eb/Bb]isin [Eb7/Db]the sky;
[Cm]The fields [Ab]are wet [Gdim]with [Ab]dia- [Fm]mond dew;
[Ab]The worlds a [Bbm]wake tocry
[Fm]Their [Cm/G]blessings [Fm/C]on [Ab]the [Cm/G]Lord [Db/Ab]of [Fm]life,
[Eb/Bb]AsHe goes meekly [Bbm]by.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Cm]Come, [Db/Ab]let [Eb7/Bb]thy [Ab]voice be one with theirs,
[Ab/Eb]Shout [Db/Ab]with [Eb/Bb]their [Fm/C]shout [Eb7/Db]of praise;
[Cm]See how [Ab]the giant sun [Eb/Bb]soars [Fm]up,
[Ab]Great lord of [Bbm]years and [Eb/Bb]days!
[Fm]So [Cm/G]let [Ab]the [Fm/C]love [Ab]of [Cm/G]Jesus [Fm]come
[Eb/Bb]And set thy [Bbm]soul ablaze.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Cm]To [Db/Ab]give [Eb7/Bb]and [Ab]give, and give again,
[Ab/Eb]What [Db/Ab]God [Eb/Bb]hath [Fm/C]given [Eb7/Db]thee;
[Cm]To spend [Ab]thyself [Gdim]nor [Ab]count [Fm]the cost;
[Ab]To serve right [Bbm]gloriously
[Fm]The [Cm/G]God [Ab]who [Fm/C]gave [Ab]all [Cm/G]worlds [Db/Ab]that [Fm]are,
[Eb/Bb]And all that [Bbm]are to be.
{end_of_verse}
